WEBVTT

00:03:58.901 --> 00:04:00.611
He searched the backyard.

00:04:00.987 --> 00:04:02.780
And then he found it in the garage.

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:04.490
And when he ran to go play with it,

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:05.783
he opened it up.

00:04:06.325 --> 00:04:08.703
And inside were winter jackets.

00:04:09.912 --> 00:04:11.914
And this was the day that the boy learned

00:04:11.914 --> 00:04:14.125
what the box was actually made to do.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:15.793
To store things.

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:18.129
Now the box is just a regular box.

00:04:18.629 --> 00:04:23.259
The boy ended up packing up his things
to go to college in that box

00:04:23.301 --> 00:04:24.760
a couple of years later.

00:04:24.802 --> 00:04:26.387
Soon after that, he used that box

00:04:26.387 --> 00:04:28.556
to move to his first home
when he got married.

00:04:28.597 --> 00:04:30.808
And then after that,
to make room for the baby,